  },
  {
   "text": "NEW: Meet the real AI ‘rogue agent’: Lord Watson of Palantir.\n\nI am sick to the teeth of this current AI hype cycle & its perversion of language. The only thing going ‘rogue’ right now are AI boosters, a gullible & compliant press & a Labour Lord \n1/\n\nbroligarchy.substack.com/p/meet-the-r...",
