   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "why would you let meta of all companies run your life via an AI agent\n\nwhat is wrong with people",
   "handle": "rincewind.run",
   "display_name": "Micah",
   "likes": 1078,
   "reposts": 92,
   "replies": 26,
   "created_at": "2026-09-28T19:54:12.634Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rincewind.run/post/3mwm3r3ruhc2m",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "I participated in some public library ai courses. I’m telling you that the state of literacies and the complexity of lives deeply enmeshed in the bowels of late stage capitalism cannot find a use case for an agent & if they could, people don’t have the scaffolding to imagine one that could be useful",
