   "text": "Fresh on the heels of similar complaints about OpenAI from mathematicians, a biologist says Anthropic’s Claude “discovered” the same system his team has spent years researching while sharing their unpublished work with Claude.\n\nIt’s no longer just publishers & artists accusing AI labs of plagiarism.",
